---
description: Skip pytest when changes are limited to CSS and HTML only
alwaysApply: true
---

# CSS/HTML changes: no test run

When a task changes **only** CSS and/or HTML (including static `.html`, `.css`, and CSS/HTML inside component templates), **do not run pytest** or other automated test suites as part of that task.

Still run tests when changes include JavaScript logic, Python/backend code, build config, or any non-presentational behavior—even if CSS/HTML is also touched.
